<h2 id='who-its-for' emoji='🎯'>🎯 Who Each Platform Is For</h2>

**Choose AWeber if:** You've been on the platform for years and your list is already there, your team is not technical and values phone support, or your email program is genuinely simple — monthly newsletters, a basic welcome sequence, and occasional promotions. There's no compelling reason to migrate if AWeber is working for you.

**Choose Moosend if:** You're starting fresh or evaluating platforms in 2026, you want to build real automated retention workflows (reactivation, post-treatment follow-ups, birthday campaigns, loyalty triggers), your list is growing and you want to control cost per subscriber, or you want one platform that handles both marketing emails and transactional appointment-related messages.

For the majority of med spa operators we work with — especially those focused on client retention, membership programs, and multi-service upsell sequences — Moosend is the stronger foundation. The tools we see driving real revenue in aesthetic practices lean on behavioral automation, and that's where Moosend has a structural advantage.

